 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Three is a Crowd</em></p>\n<p>You have trained extensively in fighting together with your Clones, gaining the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>When flanking with a Clone, you deal additional damage equal to your proficiency bonus  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can create Clones as a bonus action for 1 extra CE per clone  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When one of your Clones is reduced to 0 hit points, rather than waiting 1 minute, you only need to wait 1 round</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
